WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.990
Yes, you can fix your car yourself.

2
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:10.850
And I watched the first 10 lessons. So, I think I know what I'm doing.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.810
How many lessons are there?

4
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.350
Four hundred and fifty.

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.610
450! That'll take too long!

6
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.310
If I fix your car, I'll have it running in 10 to 15 minutes.

7
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:25.790
Where’re your tools?

8
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:33.330
I have this. And this.

9
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:39.470
Great. Um, I’ll get my tools. I’ll be back in a flash!

10
00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:41.430
But, Anna, I don’t need your ...

11
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.650
… help.

12
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.690
Pete, when I was a teenager, I was fixing cars -- myself.

13
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.630
I learned from a master.

14
00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:00.310
You can trust me.

15
00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:05.230
Okay.

16
00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:24.730
Great! But we need teamwork.

17
00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:26.490
You sit in the car.

18
00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.150
When I say “go,” you start the engine.

19
00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:33.130
Okay, go!

20
00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:36.730
Stop!

21
00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.930
Okay, go! Huh.

22
00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:47.970
It's not starting! It’s not starting!

23
00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:49.410
What’s wrong?

24
00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:53.070
This car is stupid … stupid, stupid!

25
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.710
Pete, kicking the tires will not help.

26
00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.610
Well, you did not help, Anna.

27
00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.250
You did not help!!

28
00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:04.210
Pete, Pete! Pull yourself together, man.

29
00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:06.490
Give me the keys.

30
00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:12.290
I must feel the key in the ignition and turn it myself.

31
00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:26.290
Use the key, Anna.

32
00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.470
Turn the key, Anna.

33
00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.930
What are you forgetting, Anna?

34
00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:41.210
Pete. Pete.

35
00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.270
What?

36
00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.990
You are out of gas.

37
00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.730
I can’t be out of gas.

38
00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.650
I’m out of gas.

39
00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:03.290
Sorry, Anna. I’ll go get some.

40
00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.110
Pete. You relax.

41
00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.130
Clean your face.

42
00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:13.090
You can watch the rest of your online video course.

43
00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.330
It’ll be faster if I go … in a flash.

44
00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:17.970
Until next time …
